 "conventions": {
  "root": "Every ship part and anchor descends from the root; move, rotate or scale the root only.",
  "anchors": "Local +X is the effect axis (exhaust aft; line of fire; out of the hull for docking and scar anchors); +Z as near hull-dorsal as that allows.",
  "turrets": "Rotate Turret <i> pivot about its local Z to train within its arc about the slot angle; the rest pose is the slot angle.",
  "docking": "The Colossus Mk.III grapples clamp onto the four dorsal Clamp receiver anchors (the Tarsus rides under her keel, dorsal up, same heading); Kites (P) dock on the two Kite collar anchors.",
  "metric": "Hull units; multiply by metres_per_unit for metres. Nothing in the asset is in metres."
 },
